  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Return to Learning in Flood Affected Districts.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant supports the establishment of Temporary Learning Centres (TLCs), the repair and rehabilitation of flood-affected schools, capacity building of teachers, and the provision of essential learning kits including books, stationery, and school bags in the flood-affected districts of South Punjab, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, and Sindh.</narrative>
  </description>
